   lam=1+1+1+1    k=4  residue=3 (= k-1)  alpha<=k-1 realizable: True   (FMS predicts possible)
   lam=3+2+1      k=3  residue=3 (= k)    alpha<=k-1 realizable: False  (FMS predicts False)
